Foursquare Labs, Inc. processes and transfers different categories of data, including:
- Contact Data, such as name, email address, phone number;
- Security Credentials & Account Data, such as account ID, user ID, social media username;
- Demographic Data, such as gender, age, country; and
- Geolocation Data.

Data Axle receives and handles data from various third parties. The categories of data that Data Axle processes and transfers are:

